Build a pomodoro timer app in a single HTML file with the following features:

**Core timer**: Large circular countdown (MM:SS) in center with work/break/long-break phases cycling continuously. Default durations: Work = 25 min, Break = 5 min, Long Break = 15 min. Display phase label ("Work", "Break", "Long Break"), cycle number (Pomodoro #1, etc.), and total time remaining below timer.

**Visual design**: Circular SVG progress ring that drains as time counts down, with colors changing by theme and phase. Responsive, centered layout with monospace numbers for timer.

**Controls**: Start/Pause button (shows "Start"/"Resume"/"Pause"), Skip (advance to next phase), Reset (return to start). Space key toggles start/pause. Auto-start the next session when current one ends.

**Settings panel** (gear icon, top-left): Editable numeric inputs for Work, Break, Long Break durations (1–120 min each), and pomodoros-per-long-break count (1–12). Checkbox "Tick last 10 sec" (default off) plays a soft high-frequency tick sound during final 10 seconds of any phase. All settings persist to localStorage with validation.

**Theme picker** (color dot + "Theme" button, top-right): Seven themes—Classic (default, dark warm palette), Tokyo Night, Ocean, Forest, Rose, Ember, Light—each with distinct CSS custom properties (--bg, --text, --panel, --work, --break, --accent, etc.). Persist theme choice to localStorage.

**Audio**: Generate Web Audio API chimes—three rising notes (C5 E5 G5) for work-done, two-note callback (E5 C5) for break-done. Each note has soft attack and long decay with quiet octave-up partial for shimmer. Optional ticking: high-frequency triangle wave during final 10 seconds when enabled.

**Daily yuzu counter**: Display "N yuzu earned today" with yellow/brown SVG yuzu icon below controls. Persist per-day using localStorage with date key; auto-reset at midnight. Dynamically pluralize label. Increment count when a Work session completes.

**UX**: Use `Date.now()` timestamp-based timing to survive tab throttling; update display ~4 times per second. Settings/theme panels close when clicking outside or pressing Escape. Show hint below counter: "A chime plays when each session ends. Space = start/pause." Update document title to show current time and phase. Responsive, centered layout.
